{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Choose a table presentation"},"description":"Saves one versioned contextual view for this table after its first successful build. Inspect its intent, actual schema and a bounded sample first. Prefer table for wide numeric/comparison data or when a specialized template does not fit. Otherwise bind exact column names to approved roles: cards, places (location cards, no map), products, events, jobs, people or articles. Never generate JSX, CSS or code. get_table returns record_presentation and its revision; use expected_revision 0 only when absent, otherwise the observed revision. table_version_id must be the current live_version_id. Valid bindings survive compatible refreshes; missing or incompatible visible columns fall back to Table. Set dry_run:true to verify authorization, serving version and schema without saving. Changes affect presentation only, never search, sorting, filtering or access. Returns the saved record_presentation; on view_changed reread before retrying.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"config":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"facts":{"items":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":4,"type":"array"},"fields":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"address":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"author":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"category":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"currency":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"description":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"employmentType":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"end":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"image":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"latitude":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"location":{"maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string